{"id":"stydno","lemma":"стыдно","pos":"adj","rank":863,"glosses":["one is ashamed (feeling shame or guilt)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8B%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8B%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Тебе должно быть стыдно.","en":"You should be ashamed.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Тебе за меня стыдно?","en":"Are you ashamed of me?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Вам не стыдно?","en":"Aren't you ashamed?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Мне стыдно за поведение моего сына.","en":"I am ashamed of my son's conduct.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/724817","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"conduct, behaviour"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"son","l":"сын"}]},{"text":"Его матери было стыдно за него.","en":"His mother was ashamed of him.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"mother","l":"мать"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"}]}]}